sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Attendee A
    actor B as Attendee B
    participant Router as Edge Router
    participant DB as Locked lane row
    A->>Router: Register
    B->>Router: Register
    Router->>DB: A requests SELECT FOR UPDATE
    Router->>DB: B waits for row lock
    DB-->>Router: A increments last seat
    Router-->>A: Confirmed
    DB-->>Router: B sees lane full
    Router-->>B: Queue or conflict
